  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:Arial\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/649/logo-png.png\" width=\"700\" alt=\"烈焰劍 Logo\"><br><br>\n  <h2 style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:32px\">讓火焰附加附魔顯示火焰效果</h2>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmr-expence.github.io%252fprojects%252fflaming-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/在我的網站上查看資源包！-black?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在我的網站上查看資源包！\"></a><br>\n  <br>\n  <p>此資源包會改變劍在附上火焰附加附魔時的紋理外觀。</p><p>在 1.21.4 或更低版本中需要安裝 CIT Mod，因為 1.21.5 版本新增了自訂物品紋理功能。</p><p>銅劍和獄髓劍有不同的顏色變化。</p><p>3D 狼牙棒和弓的紋理來自 tixul 的 Enchantment Outlines（附魔輪廓）</p><p>烈焰劍現已支援 tixul 的 [Enchantment Outlines](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fglowing-glints\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/glowing-glints</a>)</p><p>您可以使用 [ResPackOpts](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts</a>) 來開關資源包的特定部分</p><p>如果沒有動畫效果，請嘗試在影片設定中關閉「僅顯示可見紋理動畫」選項。</p>\n  <br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/641/wooden_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"木劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/642/stone_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"石劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/643/copper_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"銅劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/644/iron_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"鐵劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/645/golden_sword-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"金劍\"><br><br><img src=\"http://legacy.curseforge.com/undefined\" width=\"600\" alt=\"鑽石劍\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/647/fire_mace-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"狼牙棒\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1758/648/bow-jpg.jpg\" width=\"600\" alt=\"弓\"><br>\n</div>",
